<title>UK: Grupo Posadas sets $50 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Grupo Posadas sets $50 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GRUPO POSADAS SA DE CV</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     **	  MATURITY    13.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+425 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10+5	SALE LIMITS US/UK/MX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC   0.625</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
